# ── ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KEEP (do NOT ignore):
#   vcpkg_installed/   — pre-built vcpkg packages; committed so CI/teammates
#                        don't need to re-install on every clone.
#                        If your repo becomes too large, switch to vcpkg
#                        manifest mode and add vcpkg_installed/ here instead.
#   emsdk/             — Emscripten SDK; kept so web builds work offline.
#   src/               — engine source
#   projects/          — all game projects
#   *.bat              — build helper scripts (build.bat, fast_build.bat)
#   CMakeLists.txt     — all cmake files (root + subdirs)
#   vcpkg.json         — vcpkg manifest
#   run.instructions   — developer notes
# ── ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────